  "historyNote": "#4541, eff 12-9-88, EXPIRED: 12-9-94 New. #5973, eff 2-1-95; ss by #8001, eff 12-14-03; ss by #9527, eff 8-17-09; renumbered by #10081 (formerly Emp 302.10); amd by #10349, eff 5-22-13; EXPIRED 8-17-17 in paragraphs (a)-(c) and (f)-(h); ss by #13681, eff 7-3-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Emp 300)",
